  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design for rehabilitation and expansion of an urban water supply and sanitation system in Port Sudan.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Design for rehabilitation and expansion of an urban water supply and sanitation system in Port Sudan. is a component of Water for Three States (Red Sea, Gadarif and Kassala) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;1,595,113. It works in the following sector(s): Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Water resources conservation (including data collection), Basic sanitation, Water sector policy and administrative management, Waste management/disposal.</narrative>
  </description>
